{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":6,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":3107,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1898514,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":283523,"Name":"ChrissieReed","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1434224890,"LastPoster":{"Id":285958,"Name":"Thelookandlifestyle","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":35,"Preview":{"Id":1898514,"PostDate":1434224890,"PostContent":"\u00a0 I just recently got engaged and me, my fiancee and his family all agrees that a destination...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"arcussi@outlook.com","IpAddress":"117.204.16.186","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1434224526,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ChrissieReed","Id":283523,"Name":"ChrissieReed","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"117.204.16.186","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6896216ba42d98c62533df379b6fde4","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/lovin.gr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/315404_10150388292011140_505836139_10491685_1121044371_n.jpg\" alt=\"315404_10150388292011140_505836139_10491\"&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;I just recently got engaged and me, my fiancee and his family all agrees that a destination wedding would be great. I was wondering the best place for a destination wedding? I have never been out of the country so I have no idea which island is best and cheapest? I was hoping for a little help on the best place for and destination wedding and the price of it? We&#039;re trying to keep it small and intimate with only the people we really care about there. The guest list will most likely be under 100 people. Please Help!!!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/lovin.gr\/&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;http:\/\/lovin.gr\/&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898514,"PostDate":1434224890,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \n\t<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/lovin.gr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/315404_10150388292011140_505836139_10491685_1121044371_n.jpg\" alt=\"315404_10150388292011140_505836139_10491\"><\/span>\n<div  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span>I just recently got engaged and me, my fiancee and his family all agrees that a destination wedding would be great. I was wondering the best place for a destination wedding? I have never been out of the country so I have no idea which island is best and cheapest? I was hoping for a little help on the best place for and destination wedding and the price of it? We're trying to keep it small and intimate with only the people we really care about there. The guest list will most likely be under 100 people. Please Help!!!!!\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/lovin.gr\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong>http:\/\/lovin.gr\/<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"arcussi@outlook.com","IpAddress":"117.204.16.186","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1434224526,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ChrissieReed","Id":283523,"Name":"ChrissieReed","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14c74465a87bb70448aeb559c55eceb5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome to the site! There will be no shortage of suggestions and ideas here, but the very first thing I would recommend is to find a good travel agent! They will help you with all of your questions and help you figure out 1) what you really want, 2) what you really don&#039;t want, 3) what your price point is for your guests to pay, 4) your budget overall. There are so many factors that will come into play that talking to a professional is a good place to start.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mexico and Dominican Republic are I think maybe the most popular with the ladies here along with Jamaica. Obviously there a lots of other places too but I think those might be the top 3 for the ladies here. You also need to consider where you&#039;re flying from - the US or Canada - as the packages are structured a little differently, but again a travel agent will help you out with all of that.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you&#039;re located in the US the administrators of this site are destination wedding professionals. They would be able to help you review what you&#039;re looking for and help with ideas. They can also be the \"go to\" for your guests so that their questions get answered and keep the stress from you. Here&#039;s the link to contact them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding?lp-variation-id=0&amp;amp;title=Planning%20a%20Destination%20Wedding?&amp;amp;source=BDW&amp;amp;creative=WTA%20TB&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding?lp-variation-id=0&amp;amp;title=Planning%20a%20Destination%20Wedding?&amp;amp;source=BDW&amp;amp;creative=WTA%20TB&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you&#039;re in canada I know the ladies here will have different recommendations on travel agents.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898521,"PostDate":1434246784,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome to the site! There will be no shortage of suggestions and ideas here, but the very first thing I would recommend is to find a good travel agent! They will help you with all of your questions and help you figure out 1) what you really want, 2) what you really don't want, 3) what your price point is for your guests to pay, 4) your budget overall. There are so many factors that will come into play that talking to a professional is a good place to start.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Mexico and Dominican Republic are I think maybe the most popular with the ladies here along with Jamaica. Obviously there a lots of other places too but I think those might be the top 3 for the ladies here. You also need to consider where you're flying from - the US or Canada - as the packages are structured a little differently, but again a travel agent will help you out with all of that.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you're located in the US the administrators of this site are destination wedding professionals. They would be able to help you review what you're looking for and help with ideas. They can also be the \"go to\" for your guests so that their questions get answered and keep the stress from you. Here's the link to contact them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding?lp-variation-id=0&title=Planning%20a%20Destination%20Wedding?&source=BDW&creative=WTA%20TB' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.wrighttr...creative=WTA TB<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you're in canada I know the ladies here will have different recommendations on travel agents.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4707c3a1683d5e5ef7aa0076cd9b646","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;@[member=\"ChrissieReed\"], Congrats on your engagement!!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;We have a beautiful and unique location at the south of the bay of Puerto Vallarta, Mexico that, as you can see it&#039;s reviewed as a top venue for Destination Weddings. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;We do not only provide a coordinator to assist you during the planning and excecution of the event itself but also Caletas is an amazing place sorrounded by nature, you will say your I do&#039;s right at this beautiful beach and your guest will enjoy dinner and reception overlooking the beautiful sea.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;If you want to find more about our packages you can visit our website ar reach us at our toll free number.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;Allow us to take care of this once in a lifetime event, were you just have to relax and enjoy!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81539]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79107]\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79015]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#61a5b9;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"&gt;Adventure Weddings &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;\"&gt;www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#61a5b9;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"&gt;Toll Free: 1 866.731.8152&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/AdventureWedding&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:1pt;\"&gt;VAD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/adventurew\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:1pt;\"&gt;VAD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21577-adventure-weddings-las-caletas\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900700,"PostDate":1437243832,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283523\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/283523-chrissiereed\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ChrissieReed<\/span><\/a>, Congrats on your engagement!!!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">We have a beautiful and unique location at the south of the bay of Puerto Vallarta, Mexico that, as you can see it's reviewed as a top venue for Destination Weddings. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">We do not only provide a coordinator to assist you during the planning and excecution of the event itself but also Caletas is an amazing place sorrounded by nature, you will say your I do's right at this beautiful beach and your guest will enjoy dinner and reception overlooking the beautiful sea.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">If you want to find more about our packages you can visit our website ar reach us at our toll free number.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">Allow us to take care of this once in a lifetime event, were you just have to relax and enjoy!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81539-ceremony-set-up-at-las-caletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18067\/sml_gallery_258213_18067_5088322.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Ceremony set up at Las Caletas'  width='133' height='200'  alt='Ceremony set up at Las Caletas' id='sml_image_view_81539' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/79107-all\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_13408.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='All'  width='200' height='134'  alt='All' id='sml_image_view_79107' \/><\/a>\n<br \/>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/79015-ready\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_726279.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='ready'  width='200' height='134'  alt='ready' id='sml_image_view_79015' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p><span  style=\"color:#000000\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#61a5b9\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:9pt\">Adventure Weddings <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a href='https:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:8.5pt\">www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><span  style=\"color:#61a5b9\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:9pt\">Toll Free: 1 866.731.8152<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/AdventureWedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span  style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:1pt\">VAD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/adventurew\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span  style=\"color:#FFFFFF\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:1pt\">VAD<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21577-adventure-weddings-las-caletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman', serif;\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><\/span><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343062403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"115.187.49.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d08de5cb5242d29bde76256827361800","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;USA is the right place for destination wedding and of course it&#039;s a very special day for you so that i&#039;ll give you their contact details i&#039;m sure it will be helpful &lt;span&gt;Florida Wedding Destinations, &lt;span&gt;Forte Affair you can contact they through &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.hotfrog.com\/Products\/Wedding-Destination&#039;&gt;Hotfrog Wedding Destination&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Contact them ASAP&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902400,"PostDate":1439449928,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>USA is the right place for destination wedding and of course it's a very special day for you so that i'll give you their contact details i'm sure it will be helpful <span>Florida Wedding Destinations, <span>Forte Affair you can contact they through <a href='http:\/\/www.hotfrog.com\/Products\/Wedding-Destination' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Hotfrog Wedding Destination<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><span>Contact them ASAP<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>jaicolebe<br>\n\u00a0","Email":"jaicolebe@gmail.com","IpAddress":"115.187.59.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439221620,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jaicolebe","Id":284350,"Name":"jaicolebe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.173.43.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3db2cc9d60e2c1c4ffb08d7db14db5c0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;First of all my heartiest congratulations for your upcoming marriage. In my view Houston is the best place for marriage and there are various wedding resorts which you can easily afford. This is I am telling to you, because my marriage was also arranged there and at House Plantation resorts. If you wants to know about its current rates you can either visit personally to them or visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/houseplantation.com\/facilities\/.%C2%A0&#039;&gt;http:\/\/houseplantation.com\/facilities\/.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902652,"PostDate":1439817172,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>First of all my heartiest congratulations for your upcoming marriage. In my view Houston is the best place for marriage and there are various wedding resorts which you can easily afford. This is I am telling to you, because my marriage was also arranged there and at House Plantation resorts. If you wants to know about its current rates you can either visit personally to them or visit\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/houseplantation.com\/facilities\/.%C2%A0' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/houseplantati...m\/facilities\/.\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jonessamuel985@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.173.43.157","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439816425,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284454.jpg?_r=1440496095","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"samueljames","Id":284454,"Name":"samueljames","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.209.58.229","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79272,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb042d78ba3dd3143c8b019825c0cfd4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HI there!&amp;nbsp; Congratulations.&amp;nbsp; Have you looked into St. Augustine Florida?&amp;nbsp; They have some beautiful wedding venues.&amp;nbsp; I can give you some additional information if you&#039;re interested.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909712,"PostDate":1453226174,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HI there!\u00a0 Congratulations.\u00a0 Have you looked into St. Augustine Florida?\u00a0 They have some beautiful wedding venues.\u00a0 I can give you some additional information if you're interested.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thelookandlifestyle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.209.58.229","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453225658,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Thelookandlifestyle","Id":285958,"Name":"Thelookandlifestyle","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79272","Title":"Best Place For Destination Wedding?","LastPostDate":1453226174},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
