, but the entire wedding cruise review will be under the Cruise section as we booked the wedding at the Pier House separately from the cruise and the reception and dinner were back on the boat. Please bear with me as I am not sure about posting the pictures.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Wedding Day 3\/29-Key West&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; CEREMONY-&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Pulled into port around 7am and the forecast was for a 30% chance of rain.&amp;nbsp; I was very worried and went up to the Lido deck to get a look and it was beautiful and then it hit me-I WAS GETTING MARRIED!&amp;nbsp; I took a few minutes to catch my breath while watching the sunrise and some of my friends joined me on deck for some pictures.&amp;nbsp; The weather was beautiful and I was ready to get off the boat and head to the Pier House for hair and makeup.&amp;nbsp; The Imagination docked at the Navy Mole pier south of town, you cannot get directly off of the boat and walk because it is an active Navy base, but trolleys and trains were provided to take you to town.&amp;nbsp; The Pier House is located at 1 Duval Street and it was very convenient as the trains and vans dropped you off right in front of the Pier House.&amp;nbsp; The green and orange trolleys dropped guests off by the Sponge Market further away, so you may want to ask which one will drop you closer to your destination.&amp;nbsp; Got to the Pier House at 8am and the room that I rented for 4 hours was not ready, had to wait and was finally able to get into the room at 8:30.&amp;nbsp; We had a room in the Caribbean Spa building and it was very roomy for me and the bridesmaids to get ready in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Elena Southcott came to my room to do airbrush makeup and my hair.&amp;nbsp; I cannot say enough great things about airbrush makeup as I did not have to touch up my makeup all day and my hair was absolutely gorgeous.&amp;nbsp; I did not do a trial run, but brought a few pictures of ideas that I wanted and Elena knew exactly what would work for me.&amp;nbsp; My makeup was natural looking and my hair was breathtaking. Thank you Elena and Olga!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Next, Peter and Sharon Estenoz of EZWeddingsinparadise.com came to my room.&amp;nbsp; I cannot say enough great things about this couple.&amp;nbsp; They were very prompt in responding to emails, stayed in touch with me throughout the planning stages and were the sweetest couple.&amp;nbsp; Sharon does the officiating for the ceremony and worked with me in developing my own ceremony which she loved! Peter is the photographer and knows exactly what makes you look and feel beautiful.&amp;nbsp; He was joking with me and having a fun time, like I have known them for years!&amp;nbsp; Peter took a lot of getting ready shots before it was time to go, we even hopped on some guys motorcycle on the way for a few shots!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I had 4 bridesmaids and 2 maids of honor and the girls had everything under control.&amp;nbsp; There is a new wedding coordinator at the Pier House and I was very nervous.&amp;nbsp; The ceremony was scheduled to start at 10:30am with prelude music(steel drums) starting at 10:15am and my bridesmaids were not allowed at the ceremony site because there was a yoga class going on.&amp;nbsp; I also had emailed Karen at the Pier House with a diagram of the seating arrangement-I noticed in a lot of pictures the groomsmen were standing right in front of guests as the chairs were not arranged properly(brides side was facing the ceremony, the grooms side was facing the bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s guests).&amp;nbsp; I even emailed here with the design layout and the chairs were still placed wrong, we also did not get the white chair covers that I had paid for in the chair set up fee, but the chairs were nice and white so I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t complain.&amp;nbsp; The ceremony was beautiful and intimate and exactly what I had dreamed about.&amp;nbsp; We went to the back and had a mini receiving line to thank all of the guests for coming and took more pictures.&amp;nbsp; It was absolutely fantastic as I did not feel rushed and was able to truly take it all in and feel all the love around us!&amp;nbsp; The package at the Pier House included the photos and was a great deal.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We scheduled the reception back on the boat at 2pm to give the guests time to walk around Key West while we were taking couple pictures and it was perfect.&amp;nbsp; No one felt rushed to get back on the ship or that they missed out on a port and we had enough time to take some great pictures with Peter and Sharon.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; OVERALL RATING:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Elena Southcott-A+-I cried when I saw what I looked like-natural and beautiful&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Peter and Sharon Estenoz-ezweddingsinparadise.com-A+++++-loved them!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Pier House Resort-B+-could have been a little more organized and scheduled enough time to set my chairs up properly&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;9246&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;100_2213A.jpg&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;100&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;jpg&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;9249&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;100_2212A.jpg&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;105&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;jpg&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;9250&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;DSCN4120A.jpg&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;82&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;jpg&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;9251&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;DSCN4126A.JPG&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;77&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;JPG&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":21372,"Name":"100_2213A.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2011\/post-21624-138622229656.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2011\/post-21624-138622229656_thumb.jpg","Width":396,"Height":297},{"Id":21373,"Name":"100_2212A.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2011\/post-21624-138622229672.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2011\/post-21624-138622229672_thumb.jpg","Width":347,"Height":462},{"Id":21374,"Name":"DSCN4120A.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2011\/post-21624-138622229679.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2011\/post-21624-138622229679_thumb.jpg","Width":730,"Height":548},{"Id":21375,"Name":"DSCN4126A.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2011\/post-21624-138622229692.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2011\/post-21624-138622229692_thumb.jpg","Width":613,"Height":548}],"Id":1430725,"PostDate":1302145265,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Well just got back from my wedding cruise and had a wonderful wedding and spectacular cruise.\u00a0 I will just put the ceremony review here in the Florida section, but the entire wedding cruise review will be under the Cruise section as we booked the wedding at the Pier House separately from the cruise and the reception and dinner were back on the boat. Please bear with me as I am not sure about posting the pictures.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Wedding Day 3\/29-Key West<\/p> <p> CEREMONY-<\/p> <p> Pulled into port around 7am and the forecast was for a 30% chance of rain.\u00a0 I was very worried and went up to the Lido deck to get a look and it was beautiful and then it hit me-I WAS GETTING MARRIED!\u00a0 I took a few minutes to catch my breath while watching the sunrise and some of my friends joined me on deck for some pictures.\u00a0 The weather was beautiful and I was ready to get off the boat and head to the Pier House for hair and makeup.\u00a0 The Imagination docked at the Navy Mole pier south of town, you cannot get directly off of the boat and walk because it is an active Navy base, but trolleys and trains were provided to take you to town.\u00a0 The Pier House is located at 1 Duval Street and it was very convenient as the trains and vans dropped you off right in front of the Pier House.\u00a0 The green and orange trolleys dropped guests off by the Sponge Market further away, so you may want to ask which one will drop you closer to your destination.\u00a0 Got to the Pier House at 8am and the room that I rented for 4 hours was not ready, had to wait and was finally able to get into the room at 8:30.\u00a0 We had a room in the Caribbean Spa building and it was very roomy for me and the bridesmaids to get ready in.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Elena Southcott came to my room to do airbrush makeup and my hair.\u00a0 I cannot say enough great things about airbrush makeup as I did not have to touch up my makeup all day and my hair was absolutely gorgeous.\u00a0 I did not do a trial run, but brought a few pictures of ideas that I wanted and Elena knew exactly what would work for me.\u00a0 My makeup was natural looking and my hair was breathtaking. Thank you Elena and Olga!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Next, Peter and Sharon Estenoz of EZWeddingsinparadise.com came to my room.\u00a0 I cannot say enough great things about this couple.\u00a0 They were very prompt in responding to emails, stayed in touch with me throughout the planning stages and were the sweetest couple.\u00a0 Sharon does the officiating for the ceremony and worked with me in developing my own ceremony which she loved! Peter is the photographer and knows exactly what makes you look and feel beautiful.\u00a0 He was joking with me and having a fun time, like I have known them for years!\u00a0 Peter took a lot of getting ready shots before it was time to go, we even hopped on some guys motorcycle on the way for a few shots!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I had 4 bridesmaids and 2 maids of honor and the girls had everything under control.\u00a0 There is a new wedding coordinator at the Pier House and I was very nervous.\u00a0 The ceremony was scheduled to start at 10:30am with prelude music(steel drums) starting at 10:15am and my bridesmaids were not allowed at the ceremony site because there was a yoga class going on.\u00a0 I also had emailed Karen at the Pier House with a diagram of the seating arrangement-I noticed in a lot of pictures the groomsmen were standing right in front of guests as the chairs were not arranged properly(brides side was facing the ceremony, the grooms side was facing the bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s guests).\u00a0 I even emailed here with the design layout and the chairs were still placed wrong, we also did not get the white chair covers that I had paid for in the chair set up fee, but the chairs were nice and white so I didn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t complain.\u00a0 The ceremony was beautiful and intimate and exactly what I had dreamed about.\u00a0 We went to the back and had a mini receiving line to thank all of the guests for coming and took more pictures.\u00a0 It was absolutely fantastic as I did not feel rushed and was able to truly take it all in and feel all the love around us!\u00a0 The package at the Pier House included the photos and was a great deal.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We scheduled the reception back on the boat at 2pm to give the guests time to walk around Key West while we were taking couple pictures and it was perfect.\u00a0 No one felt rushed to get back on the ship or that they missed out on a port and we had enough time to take some great pictures with Peter and Sharon.<\/p> <p> OVERALL RATING:<\/p> <p> Elena Southcott-A+-I cried when I saw what I looked like-natural and beautiful<\/p> <p> Peter and Sharon Estenoz-ezweddingsinparadise.com-A+++++-loved them!<\/p> <p> Pier House Resort-B+-could have been a little more organized and scheduled enough time to set my chairs up properly<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"9246\",\"name\":\"100_2213A.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"100\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"9249\",\"name\":\"100_2212A.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"105\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"9250\",\"name\":\"DSCN4120A.jpg\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"82\",\"type\":\"jpg\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"9251\",\"name\":\"DSCN4126A.JPG\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"77\",\"type\":\"JPG\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hzak@cfl.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1255210392,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222511.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hzak1203","Id":222511,"Name":"hzak1203","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60600,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"166e8f6e9137d617628c721f9bf476ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m excited to see you had an excellent expierence with ezweddingsinparadise.com I came across their website and they seem promising! Thanks for your review.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1434374,"PostDate":1302746378,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm excited to see you had an excellent expierence with ezweddingsinparadise.com I came across their website and they seem promising! Thanks for your review.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><em>03.13.13 ~ The day I marry my best friend!<\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mypawco@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1302745651,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238853.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":231,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"baileybutton","Id":238853,"Name":"baileybutton","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60600,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e50b5d9325eb887c17aa3ebe9f1e8505","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; sounds great, congrats&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1548021,"PostDate":1321593359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> sounds great, congrats<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melbivona@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1321128796,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247597.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"melbivona","Id":247597,"Name":"melbivona","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60600,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93f63ca208c17d110cb7f800cc9e2e37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; sounds great, congrats&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1548022,"PostDate":1321593404,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> sounds great, congrats<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melbivona@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1321128796,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247597.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"melbivona","Id":247597,"Name":"melbivona","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60600,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ed43d73baaf3246b32927df48c740c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congratulations! I&#039;m glad you didn&#039;t sweat the small stuff and enjoyed the day. I was just in Key West on a cruise and loved it. Great choice!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1548510,"PostDate":1321738551,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congratulations! I'm glad you didn't sweat the small stuff and enjoyed the day. I was just in Key West on a cruise and loved it. Great choice!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrobbins3@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315584130,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245110.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsF","Id":245110,"Name":"FutureMrsF","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60600,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34b8af06279e6cd98e4c748c537919e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just put a deposit down for Sharon and Peter.&amp;nbsp; I love them and they are super sweet and very accommodating with your wishes!&amp;nbsp; My wedding is on Smathers Beach August 12, 2012.&amp;nbsp; Just me and my husband-to-be!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572678,"PostDate":1327454279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just put a deposit down for Sharon and Peter.\u00a0 I love them and they are super sweet and very accommodating with your wishes!\u00a0 My wedding is on Smathers Beach August 12, 2012.\u00a0 Just me and my husband-to-be!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nkkilmer@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1326988494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250174.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NikkiK1","Id":250174,"Name":"NikkiK1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60600,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4cccb74b7b2076fe995139237a9ebfe4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; sounds wonderful! Thank you for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1637050,"PostDate":1341198560,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> sounds wonderful! Thank you for sharing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cshawen@att.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1331339382,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252517.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KeyWest2012","Id":252517,"Name":"KeyWest2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":60600,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"377a2c8c3bee640305cf6ef9f766ee7a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \"&gt;I cannot say enough wonderful things about Daniel and Southermost Photography!! My venue referred me to them when I was looking for a photographer and from our first email exchange, I knew this was the guy for me! Leading up to the wedding Daniel and Julie were a breeze to get in touch with, they answered all of my questions with ease. The day of the wedding, Daniel had everyone comfortable in front of the camera.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/&gt; &lt;br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \"&gt;One of the great things about working with Southernmost Photography is that the package included photos and video! So hard to find that at a reasonable price!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/&gt; &lt;br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \"&gt;Less than a month after we came home from our wedding, we recieved our wedding photos. They were stunning! So often you hear of brides that are waiting months and months for photos, I was thrilled with the turn around time!! They also put together an absolutely fabulous wedding album for us. I get so many compliments on the album when people see it. It is so different than what most people get!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/&gt; &lt;br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \"&gt;Without hesitation I would recommend Daniel and the team!! They are fabulous! The photos we have are true artwork! Such a talented photographer and a great company. I tell everyone my most favorite Key West find was Southernmost Photography!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1639254,"PostDate":1341737254,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px\">I cannot say enough wonderful things about Daniel and Southermost Photography!! My venue referred me to them when I was looking for a photographer and from our first email exchange, I knew this was the guy for me! Leading up to the wedding Daniel and Julie were a breeze to get in touch with, they answered all of my questions with ease. The day of the wedding, Daniel had everyone comfortable in front of the camera.\u00a0<\/span><br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/> <br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/> <span  style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px\">One of the great things about working with Southernmost Photography is that the package included photos and video! So hard to find that at a reasonable price!<\/span><br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/> <br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/> <span  style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px\">Less than a month after we came home from our wedding, we recieved our wedding photos. They were stunning! So often you hear of brides that are waiting months and months for photos, I was thrilled with the turn around time!! They also put together an absolutely fabulous wedding album for us. I get so many compliments on the album when people see it. It is so different than what most people get!<\/span><br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/> <br style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; \" \/> <span  style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, arial, sans-serif;font-size: 12px\">Without hesitation I would recommend Daniel and the team!! They are fabulous! The photos we have are true artwork! Such a talented photographer and a great company. I tell everyone my most favorite Key West find was Southernmost Photography!<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Daniel Kolbe<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>Owner\/Photographer<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>Southernmost Photography<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>Keywestweddingphotography.com<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"southernmostphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1327564003,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Southern Photos","Id":250512,"Name":"Southern Photos","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60600,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"804b262832d2b3f7135480c1d24cbee0","RawContent":"Nikki1, congrats and I bet you are super excited with you big day being only days away! I have been talking with Sharon and am really considering putting a deposit down. Can you please let me know how everything goes? I really want to see someone&#039;s photos too.","Attachments":[],"Id":1660772,"PostDate":1346964158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Nikki1, congrats and I bet you are super excited with you big day being only days away! I have been talking with Sharon and am really considering putting a deposit down. Can you please let me know how everything goes? I really want to see someone's photos too.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sontag_carlie@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308102808,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241155.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"casontag","Id":241155,"Name":"casontag","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60600,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94cc3469fb76389a4caf28b2c498bcae","RawContent":"I just realized your date. How did it go?","Attachments":[],"Id":1660773,"PostDate":1346964302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just realized your date. How did it go?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sontag_carlie@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308102808,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241155.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"casontag","Id":241155,"Name":"casontag","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"60600","Title":"Key West Wedding Review","LastPostDate":1346964302},"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
