{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51514,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb463f72781ec762ee70a8759b475b90","RawContent":"Is this possible? I&#039;ve only found a couple... I found a bunch of great deals for Mexico but my family isn&#039;t digging it. I think just because it&#039;s out of the country they assume it&#039;s going to blow their bank account.\n \n Anyways.... does anyone have suggestions??","Attachments":[],"Id":1138177,"PostDate":1273013983,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Is this possible? I've only found a couple... I found a bunch of great deals for Mexico but my family isn't digging it. I think just because it's out of the country they assume it's going to blow their bank account.<br \/> <br \/> Anyways.... does anyone have suggestions??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bbelair@mtbt.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1266465966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225692.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bbelair","Id":225692,"Name":"bbelair","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51514,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80b048208b01e159ea1d68d05b024372","RawContent":"If you are looking for something with a Beach Destination feel I would check into something in the Keys, I am not sure of any &amp;quot;True&amp;quot; All-Inclusives, but there has to be something down there I would think. If you are looking for Family and\/or Fun, try Disney World, they have meal packages that you can include with your stay and tickets. We did this last year for our Vacation and did the Disney Meal Plan, which actually was included in our stay for free because we had booked for a certain amount of days. I believe they also do payment plans for your packages if booked far enough in advance. Plus there are ways to have a non-Disney wedding. I attended a wedding there that was about 40 people and they did an amazing job with everything!!!!\n :) Good Luck!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1147513,"PostDate":1273709599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                If you are looking for something with a Beach Destination feel I would check into something in the Keys, I am not sure of any \"True\" All-Inclusives, but there has to be something down there I would think. If you are looking for Family and\/or Fun, try Disney World, they have meal packages that you can include with your stay and tickets. We did this last year for our Vacation and did the Disney Meal Plan, which actually was included in our stay for free because we had booked for a certain amount of days. I believe they also do payment plans for your packages if booked far enough in advance. Plus there are ways to have a non-Disney wedding. I attended a wedding there that was about 40 people and they did an amazing job with everything!!!!<br \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Good Luck!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danyetteosborne@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1252358100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221384.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"roxyqt","Id":221384,"Name":"roxyqt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51514,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c7e6b60976a867776c186de1b79a4e9","RawContent":"Thanks so much!! You are the second person to tell me about Disney&#039;s meal plans today!! I&#039;m going to have to check it out!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1147518,"PostDate":1273709818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks so much!! You are the second person to tell me about Disney's meal plans today!! I'm going to have to check it out!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bbelair@mtbt.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1266465966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225692.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bbelair","Id":225692,"Name":"bbelair","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51514,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb06b04716e05db18741f84c5e591f58","RawContent":"The plans can be great and since they were included in our package, we didn&#039;t feel as guilty if we decided to stray off the plan to have a nicer Dinner somewhere. They explain where and how to use them on &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.disney.com\"&gt;Disney | Official Home Page for All Things Disney&lt;\/a&gt; Disney is a great place to have a wedding, but I know can be really expensive. It may be more something your family could enjoy :). I actually had another friend get Married at a Hotel in Downtown Disney, called Buena Vista Palace. It was really nice!! Most of us stayed on Disney Property, and the others at BVP, they have transportation provided as well to the parks and if you are looking for a place to have the wedding to reduce cost look into other Hotels that are close and just travel to them from your Disney Resort:). Not to mention surrounding Theme parks are having great deals on tickets!! Lots of Luck!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1148290,"PostDate":1273750407,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The plans can be great and since they were included in our package, we didn't feel as guilty if we decided to stray off the plan to have a nicer Dinner somewhere. They explain where and how to use them on <a href='http:\/\/www.disney.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Disney | Official Home Page for All Things Disney<\/a> Disney is a great place to have a wedding, but I know can be really expensive. It may be more something your family could enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. I actually had another friend get Married at a Hotel in Downtown Disney, called Buena Vista Palace. It was really nice!! Most of us stayed on Disney Property, and the others at BVP, they have transportation provided as well to the parks and if you are looking for a place to have the wedding to reduce cost look into other Hotels that are close and just travel to them from your Disney Resort:). Not to mention surrounding Theme parks are having great deals on tickets!! Lots of Luck!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danyetteosborne@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1252358100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221384.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"roxyqt","Id":221384,"Name":"roxyqt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51514,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba0d42db7dd83d8d6155001f8f764b7b","RawContent":"Disney has the meal plans, and I believe there is a Club Med in Florida, but I don&#039;t think booze is included with either package.","Attachments":[],"Id":1148347,"PostDate":1273769973,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Disney has the meal plans, and I believe there is a Club Med in Florida, but I don't think booze is included with either package.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>LeAnne & John<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wTFJpHP\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...pHP\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/bls63.jpg\">http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h3...nde2\/bls63.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"Collegetigrrrl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.232.88.151","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1211497684,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209540.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":94,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sapphire723","Id":209540,"Name":"Sapphire723","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51514,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d84171dabb280797a85516227de7fe7e","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Sapphire723&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Disney has the meal plans, and I believe there is a Club Med in Florida, but I don&#039;t think booze is included with either package.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;For sure with the Disney package, Alcohol is not included. With our meal plan we received a non-alcoholic beverage with each meal. So still not a &amp;quot;true&amp;quot; all-inclusive, its more like being on a cruise ship :), you get the meals but have to pay for your booze :).","Attachments":[],"Id":1149613,"PostDate":1273825112,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Sapphire723<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Disney has the meal plans, and I believe there is a Club Med in Florida, but I don't think booze is included with either package.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>For sure with the Disney package, Alcohol is not included. With our meal plan we received a non-alcoholic beverage with each meal. So still not a \"true\" all-inclusive, its more like being on a cruise ship <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>, you get the meals but have to pay for your booze <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danyetteosborne@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1252358100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221384.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"roxyqt","Id":221384,"Name":"roxyqt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":51514,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"086204dca142ab60420151433701432b","RawContent":"Clearwater or St. Peteresburg Beach are great choices - not too far from Orlando also. The Sandpearl resort and The Don Cesar are first class and on amazing beaches.","Attachments":[],"Id":1179312,"PostDate":1276147933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Clearwater or St. Peteresburg Beach are great choices - not too far from Orlando also. The Sandpearl resort and The Don Cesar are first class and on amazing beaches.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Photobeat@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1275779722,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228901.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Stephen Dohring","Id":228901,"Name":"Stephen Dohring","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51514,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d72c3ff8790fd7de7b77fc49656aa5f","RawContent":"The only truly all inclusive resort I know of is Club Med in Sandpiper. If you are thinking of the Keys then Little Palm Island does have an all-inclusive package but be fore warned LPI is expensive....but so worth it!!! Its out of this world exquisite. Naples Grande Beach Resort used to offer an all-inclusive package as well but I checked the website and it seems they are down to only offering breakfast at best. Amelia Island Plantation offers all-inclusive packages as well but be fore-warned that though Amelia Island is beautiful it is very far removed from anything...its in a little world up in North Florida all of its own....I stayed at the Ritz Carlton for a week and a half and after three days I was going stir crazy...lol. Good luck hope this helps....oh yes and there is always Disney, you can&#039;t go wrong with Disney.","Attachments":[],"Id":1179574,"PostDate":1276159222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The only truly all inclusive resort I know of is Club Med in Sandpiper. If you are thinking of the Keys then Little Palm Island does have an all-inclusive package but be fore warned LPI is expensive....but so worth it!!! Its out of this world exquisite. Naples Grande Beach Resort used to offer an all-inclusive package as well but I checked the website and it seems they are down to only offering breakfast at best. Amelia Island Plantation offers all-inclusive packages as well but be fore-warned that though Amelia Island is beautiful it is very far removed from anything...its in a little world up in North Florida all of its own....I stayed at the Ritz Carlton for a week and a half and after three days I was going stir crazy...lol. Good luck hope this helps....oh yes and there is always Disney, you can't go wrong with Disney.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janinelatkinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1263772522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224781.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JanineA","Id":224781,"Name":"JanineA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51514,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"270f6ac8c7c0e6ca191aaec4329cb5f5","RawContent":"If you have any questions about Disney, feel free to ask me &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheesy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; We&#039;re getting married there in February 2012 ^_^","Attachments":[],"Id":1179791,"PostDate":1276194731,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                If you have any questions about Disney, feel free to ask me <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheesy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> We're getting married there in February 2012 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/happy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='^_^' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sharmaineking@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1216018294,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210518.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":181,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsLewis","Id":210518,"Name":"FutureMrsLewis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51514,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d99c32698c2e518993b8fe36919da8a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Where can I find Disney wedding information?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572413,"PostDate":1327430979,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Where can I find Disney wedding information?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blkbeautycece@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1324964849,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"blkbeautycece","Id":248948,"Name":"blkbeautycece","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
